WEBVTT

00:00:00.660 --> 00:00:02.060
Shadow card?

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:05.650
You're giving it to us?

00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:10.040
As long as you have that card, 
you'll no longer struggle.

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:11.860
You'll win all your duels.

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:13.690
You can even become King.

00:00:15.590 --> 00:00:17.530
A shadow card...

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:19.760
Interesting.

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:28.710
I summon Rose Tentacles!

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:36.980
My powers didn't activate?

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:46.620
That's the monster that locked the wheels!

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:50.590
I was waiting for that crooked monster!

00:00:50.590 --> 00:00:55.370
Bring it on!  I'll find out 
how you lock the wheels!

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:59.820
Sirocco the Dawn attacks 
Hook the Hidden Knight!

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:01.670
Dark Wing Slash!

00:01:04.240 --> 00:01:05.680
Crow is attacking!

00:01:05.980 --> 00:01:08.410
That attack can't defeat me!

00:01:08.410 --> 00:01:12.150
I activate Hook the Hidden 
Knight's effect!  Shadow Hook!

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:19.620
If you attack this card when it's in attack 
position, both our monsters switch to defense position!

00:01:23.330 --> 00:01:26.460
Since they're both in defense 
position, the battle is negated!

00:01:26.460 --> 00:01:30.810
When Hook the Hidden Knight switches 
from attack to defense position,

00:01:30.810 --> 00:01:34.220
you take 800 points of damage.

00:01:34.220 --> 00:01:35.450
Take it!

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:40.910
I'm feeling an impact!

00:02:00.930 --> 00:02:03.900
Crow managed to survive!

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:10.340
I missed.  What a lucky punk.

00:02:10.340 --> 00:02:12.090
What was that?

00:02:12.090 --> 00:02:14.810
There was something next to the wheel.

00:02:15.020 --> 00:02:17.370
What was that?

00:02:20.920 --> 00:02:22.280
No way!

00:02:22.280 --> 00:02:24.750
It was that monster's hand!

00:02:24.750 --> 00:02:25.900
Impossible!

00:02:25.900 --> 00:02:28.670
How can it come out of the shadows?

00:02:28.670 --> 00:02:30.720
I don't know, but there's no mistake!

00:02:30.720 --> 00:02:32.240
That's creepy.

00:02:32.240 --> 00:02:35.700
That monster isn't a Solid Vision hologram?

00:02:39.380 --> 00:02:42.370
So that's how he did it.

00:02:42.720 --> 00:02:45.610
If it locks my wheels, I'm done for.

00:02:46.870 --> 00:02:49.080
The pain is back.

00:02:49.080 --> 00:02:52.350
I can't let this duel last much longer.

00:02:52.600 --> 00:02:55.580
I set four cards and end my turn!

00:02:57.920 --> 00:03:00.780
Crow is rushing this battle.

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:03.120
His shoulder must hurt more than we thought.

00:03:04.130 --> 00:03:05.660
How pointless.

00:03:06.010 --> 00:03:10.630
No matter what trap you set, victory is ours 
as long as we have Hook the Hidden Knight!

00:03:11.760 --> 00:03:13.500
I won't miss this time.

00:03:13.900 --> 00:03:15.160
My turn!

00:03:16.760 --> 00:03:20.070
I switch Hook the Hidden 
Knight to attack position.

00:03:21.130 --> 00:03:23.680
Then I summon Dark the Hidden Knight!

00:03:27.360 --> 00:03:30.620
This card can attack you directly.

00:03:30.890 --> 00:03:33.480
Dark the Hidden Knight attacks you directly!

00:03:35.750 --> 00:03:36.720
Crow!

00:03:37.200 --> 00:03:40.420
Then Hook the Hidden Knight 
attacks Sirocco the Dawn!

00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:41.960
Devil Hook!

00:03:43.690 --> 00:03:44.660
Here it comes!

00:03:49.780 --> 00:03:51.640
Riding Duels.

00:03:51.640 --> 00:03:54.730
These duels evolved in the world of speed.

00:03:54.730 --> 00:04:01.300
The people with the legendary marks who 
risked their lives were known as 5D's.

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:22.810
Reach out your hand and 
grab a bright tomorrow

00:04:22.810 --> 00:04:32.600
Soar in the infinite skies   BELIEVE IN NEXUS

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:38.920
No one can stop my wild impulses

00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:45.010
My hand sweats as the battle 
intensifies  This Heart Beat

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:50.790
I can't avoid this fearsome battle

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:56.630
I don't want it to end here  Go For It!!

00:04:57.300 --> 00:05:02.790
Stand up  Don't tremble in fear alone

00:05:02.790 --> 00:05:08.600
Remember that you have 
friends waiting for you

00:05:08.600 --> 00:05:14.770
I'm not scared and I'll never give 
up, no matter how powerful the enemy

00:05:14.770 --> 00:05:21.190
With real courage, I'll never lose

00:05:45.080 --> 00:05:50.980
Shadow CardHook the Hidden Knight

00:05:59.830 --> 00:06:01.150
He dodged it?

00:06:01.150 --> 00:06:04.660
No way!  That had to be luck!

00:06:04.900 --> 00:06:06.030
Crow!

00:06:09.450 --> 00:06:10.480
You punk...

00:06:10.480 --> 00:06:11.970
Whoa!  What happened?

00:06:12.330 --> 00:06:14.940
Is there a problem with Crow's D-Wheel?

00:06:17.770 --> 00:06:20.510
I set one card and end my turn.

00:06:23.280 --> 00:06:24.760
Did you see that, Yusei?

00:06:24.760 --> 00:06:25.450
Yeah.

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:28.540
Why is a shadow attacking?

00:06:30.860 --> 00:06:32.660
What was that hook?

00:06:34.280 --> 00:06:36.730
He can't battle with that shoulder!

00:06:37.100 --> 00:06:38.540
Make him make a pit stop!

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:39.560
Got it!

00:06:40.930 --> 00:06:42.870
They want him to make a pit stop!

00:06:42.870 --> 00:06:45.590
There must be a problem with his Blackbird!

00:06:46.410 --> 00:06:48.400
Crow, make a pit stop!

00:06:48.400 --> 00:06:49.940
Leave the rest to me!

00:06:49.940 --> 00:06:54.310
No!  I'll at least destroy this monster!

00:06:56.080 --> 00:06:56.880
Crow!

00:06:59.720 --> 00:07:02.720
Crow ignored the pit stop and kept going!

00:07:02.720 --> 00:07:03.950
Yusei!

00:07:05.700 --> 00:07:07.790
This is Crow's decision.

00:07:07.790 --> 00:07:09.400
Let's believe in him.

00:07:09.400 --> 00:07:12.430
I won't be held responsible 
for what happens to him!

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:17.630
My turn!

00:07:19.100 --> 00:07:21.640
I activate the trap Blackback!

00:07:22.110 --> 00:07:25.930
I can Special Summon a Blackwing 
monster from my graveyard

00:07:25.930 --> 00:07:27.610
with 2000-or-less attack points!

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:31.310
I summon Blackwing - Sirocco the Dawn!

00:07:31.310 --> 00:07:34.780
Then I Special Summon Blackwing 
- Gale the Whirlwind!

00:07:35.130 --> 00:07:40.760
When a Blackwing monster is on my field, 
I can Special Summon it from my hand!

00:07:41.200 --> 00:07:44.030
I activate Gale the Whirlwind's effect!

00:07:44.030 --> 00:07:48.780
Once per turn, your monster's attack 
and defense points are halved!

00:07:49.170 --> 00:07:55.770
I halve Hook the Hidden Knight's attack 
points, and Gale the Whirlwind attacks it!

00:07:56.300 --> 00:07:57.270
Black Scratch!

00:07:59.010 --> 00:08:02.980
But if he attacks it, it 
will use its effect again.

00:08:03.260 --> 00:08:04.840
You never give up.

00:08:04.840 --> 00:08:07.180
I activate Hook the Hidden Knight's effect.

00:08:07.690 --> 00:08:11.020
When it's attacked while in attack position,

00:08:11.020 --> 00:08:15.020
this card and the attacking monster 
both switch to defense position!

00:08:16.320 --> 00:08:21.280
Then due to its effect, you 
take 800 points of damage!

00:08:35.410 --> 00:08:37.620
He dodged it again!

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:39.950
He's unbelievable.

00:08:40.780 --> 00:08:45.210
That's why he shouldn't have attacked it!

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:48.300
But that monster is now in defense position.

00:08:49.440 --> 00:08:53.420
That monster can't be defeated as 
long as it's in attack position.

00:08:53.420 --> 00:08:58.230
But if it's in defense position, it can't 
use its effect to negate the battle.

00:08:58.540 --> 00:09:02.010
So Crow did that to switch his 
monster to defense position!

00:09:03.930 --> 00:09:07.010
Sirocco the Dawn attacks 
Hook the Hidden Knight!

00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:09.340
Dark Wing Slash!

00:09:09.980 --> 00:09:12.360
That's not going to work!

00:09:12.360 --> 00:09:15.080
I activate Dark the Hidden Knight's effect!

00:09:15.080 --> 00:09:17.450
When a monster in defense 
position is attacked,

00:09:17.720 --> 00:09:22.620
I can switch it to attack 
position by tributing this card.

00:09:23.920 --> 00:09:25.390
It's in attack position again!

00:09:25.390 --> 00:09:28.360
Then I activate Hook the 
Hidden Knight's effect!

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:34.070
It's coming!

00:09:35.830 --> 00:09:37.440
He'll crash this time!

00:09:37.770 --> 00:09:38.670
Crow!

00:09:48.600 --> 00:09:49.510
What's that?

00:09:55.270 --> 00:09:58.990
That monster was hiding in the shadow!

00:10:03.080 --> 00:10:05.800
Since I know your tricks, it won't work!

00:10:06.620 --> 00:10:09.970
But you take 800 points of damage!

00:10:13.150 --> 00:10:14.240
Crow...

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:18.120
Here I go!  I send Blackwing - 
Etesian of Two Swords from my hand

00:10:18.120 --> 00:10:20.210
to the graveyard to activate its effect!

00:10:21.720 --> 00:10:27.710
When a Blackwing fails to destroy a monster in 
battle, you take damage equal to its attack points!

00:10:31.530 --> 00:10:33.630
What incredible offense and defense!

00:10:33.630 --> 00:10:40.060
Crow took 1600 points of damage in 
order to deal 2000 points of damage!

00:10:40.060 --> 00:10:41.530
Well done, Crow!

00:10:41.530 --> 00:10:43.450
What should we do, Nicolas?

00:10:43.450 --> 00:10:44.880
Don't lose your cool!

00:10:44.880 --> 00:10:49.400
He took damage, but our opponent 
only has 800 life points left.

00:10:49.400 --> 00:10:51.010
Victory is assured.

00:10:51.290 --> 00:10:54.320
Then I activate the trap Urgent Tuning!

00:10:54.680 --> 00:10:59.780
I can Synchro Summon one Synchro 
Monster during the Battle Phase!

00:10:59.780 --> 00:11:01.340
I won't let you do that!

00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:04.760
I activate the Continuous Trap 
Shadow Concealing Darkness!

00:11:05.660 --> 00:11:08.490
Monsters in defense position 
can't be destroyed in battle!

00:11:08.760 --> 00:11:14.030
Level 3 Gale the Whirlwind 
tunes Level 5 Sirocco the Dawn!

00:11:14.030 --> 00:11:19.000
Black whirlwind, your secret 
thoughts appear on your wings!

00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:20.100
Synchro Summon!

00:11:20.760 --> 00:11:23.870
Take flight, Black-Winged Dragon!

00:11:45.490 --> 00:11:48.430
Good!  It's Crow's ace monster!

00:11:48.430 --> 00:11:50.460
But why is it in defense position?

00:11:56.850 --> 00:11:59.540
You tightened your defense because 
you know that you can't win.

00:11:59.540 --> 00:12:01.510
That's not what I did!

00:12:01.930 --> 00:12:04.340
I activate the trap Defenders Intersect!

00:12:04.810 --> 00:12:07.130
During the Battle Phase, we both negate

00:12:07.130 --> 00:12:11.220
a defense position monster's effects 
until the end of the turn...

00:12:11.220 --> 00:12:13.020
...and they're switched to attack position!

00:12:13.520 --> 00:12:17.420
Good!  Now he can't use 
his Shadow Hook effect!

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:20.760
And if it's in attack position, 
he can deal damage.

00:12:25.980 --> 00:12:28.170
2800 attack points?

00:12:28.590 --> 00:12:31.000
He only has 2000 life points left!

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:32.370
Crow will win!

00:12:34.800 --> 00:12:37.340
I will never forgive you!

00:12:39.100 --> 00:12:42.620
How dare you hurt Jan, Andore and Aki!

00:12:52.320 --> 00:12:54.990
Black-Winged Dragon is becoming more black!

00:12:55.360 --> 00:12:56.190
Crow...

00:12:58.800 --> 00:13:02.200
Black-Winged Dragon attacks 
Hook the Hidden Knight!

00:13:02.560 --> 00:13:04.110
Noble Stream!

00:13:06.270 --> 00:13:07.240
Hermann!

00:13:07.240 --> 00:13:10.080
I activate the trap Revival Knight!

00:13:21.880 --> 00:13:23.250
It's over!

00:13:23.250 --> 00:13:25.450
Crow made a come-from-behind victory!

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:28.460
According to the tournament rules, 
the duel enters the End Phase!

00:13:31.840 --> 00:13:33.260
Hooray!

00:13:33.260 --> 00:13:35.690
I won't lose like this!

00:13:35.690 --> 00:13:38.240
I activate Revival Knight's effect!

00:13:38.600 --> 00:13:43.020
At the End Phase, I can Special 
Summon a Knight in defense position

00:13:43.020 --> 00:13:45.480
that was destroyed in battle this turn.

00:13:49.270 --> 00:13:52.020
I won't let you destroy this monster!

00:13:52.400 --> 00:13:54.990
Taste the power of a shadow card!

00:13:54.990 --> 00:13:55.750
Shadow...

00:13:55.750 --> 00:13:57.000
...card?

00:14:04.600 --> 00:14:05.400
Crow!

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:09.070
I activate the trap Gravity Collapse!

00:14:09.710 --> 00:14:14.810
By sending one Synchro Monster 
on my field to the graveyard...

00:14:14.810 --> 00:14:18.910
...I can negate the summoning of a monster that 
has equal or fewer attack points and destroy it!

00:14:18.910 --> 00:14:19.880
What?

00:14:19.880 --> 00:14:20.970
Can it be?

00:14:20.970 --> 00:14:21.840
Crow!

00:14:22.090 --> 00:14:25.050
I have to at least destroy this monster.

00:14:25.370 --> 00:14:29.520
Even if I have to sacrifice 
Black-Winged Dragon!

00:15:02.650 --> 00:15:03.750
All right, Crow!

00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:06.120
You destroyed Hook the Hidden Knight!

00:15:06.460 --> 00:15:08.410
Hook the Hidden Knight was...

00:15:08.410 --> 00:15:09.920
How dare you!

00:15:11.230 --> 00:15:14.110
Crow is incredible.

00:15:14.110 --> 00:15:16.640
He had that trap ready.

00:15:16.640 --> 00:15:20.830
He anticipated that his opponent would 
resurrect Hook the Hidden Knight.

00:15:22.790 --> 00:15:24.200
I'm at my limit.

00:15:27.190 --> 00:15:30.940
Crow makes a pit stop with 
800 life points left!

00:15:30.940 --> 00:15:33.980
Did something happen to Blackbird?

00:15:35.700 --> 00:15:37.180
I got their revenge.

00:15:37.180 --> 00:15:37.960
Crow!

00:15:37.960 --> 00:15:39.490
Leave the rest to me!

00:15:42.320 --> 00:15:47.260
Team 5D's switches to their 
second wheeler Jack Atlas!

00:15:47.260 --> 00:15:51.870
According to the rules, if you pass the 
baton when you still have life points left,

00:15:51.870 --> 00:15:53.740
you forfeit those life points!

00:15:53.740 --> 00:15:57.900
Therefore, Jack starts with 4000 life points!

00:15:58.600 --> 00:15:59.840
This is what I was waiting for!

00:15:59.840 --> 00:16:03.000
Since they no longer a 
shadow card, we'll win!

00:16:03.000 --> 00:16:04.580
Master Atlas!

00:16:08.400 --> 00:16:10.860
It seems your plan failed.

00:16:18.700 --> 00:16:20.560
I'm sorry, Nicolas.

00:16:22.030 --> 00:16:23.340
Hand it over!

00:16:26.780 --> 00:16:30.740
Team Catastrophe also passes the 
baton to their second wheeler!

00:16:30.740 --> 00:16:33.450
I refuse to lose.

00:16:33.450 --> 00:16:35.470
I still have that card.

00:16:38.120 --> 00:16:40.410
Let's battle, Jack Atlas!

00:16:40.410 --> 00:16:44.050
You're so disrespectful that 
you used a shadow card!

00:16:44.600 --> 00:16:48.120
Jack Atlas will teach you 
what a real duel is about!

00:16:49.200 --> 00:16:50.100
Duel!

00:16:51.420 --> 00:16:52.630
My turn!

00:16:54.640 --> 00:16:57.610
I set one card and end my turn.

00:16:58.880 --> 00:17:00.380
One set card?

00:17:00.380 --> 00:17:02.930
He's not going to summon a monster?

00:17:04.810 --> 00:17:09.370
Do you think you can beat 
Jack Atlas with one set card?

00:17:09.370 --> 00:17:11.360
My turn!

00:17:13.140 --> 00:17:16.920
I send Level 2 Dread Dragon 
in my hand to the graveyard

00:17:16.920 --> 00:17:19.210
to Special Summon Power Giant!

00:17:23.390 --> 00:17:28.030
I can Special Summon it by lowering its Level

00:17:28.030 --> 00:17:33.030
equal to that of the Level 4-or-below 
monster that I sent to the graveyard!

00:17:33.760 --> 00:17:35.730
Go, Power Giant!

00:17:36.290 --> 00:17:37.980
Attack him directly!

00:17:38.760 --> 00:17:39.500
It's coming.

00:17:39.840 --> 00:17:42.520
I activate the trap Doom Ray!

00:17:42.900 --> 00:17:45.480
When your monster attacks me directly,

00:17:45.480 --> 00:17:50.570
we both take 800 points of damage 
for every card in my hand!

00:17:51.110 --> 00:17:56.200
Since he has five cards in his 
hand, 800 times 5 equals...

00:17:56.200 --> 00:17:57.420
4000 points!

00:17:57.960 --> 00:18:02.290
If he does that, both players 
will have 0 life points!

00:18:02.290 --> 00:18:05.000
What are you thinking?

00:18:05.000 --> 00:18:11.500
Jack Atlas, you and your D-Wheel will 
crash due to the power of the shadows!

00:18:11.500 --> 00:18:12.770
Power of the shadows?

00:18:13.200 --> 00:18:16.770
Hook the Hidden Knight 
isn't the only shadow card.

00:18:18.230 --> 00:18:19.720
Power of the shadows?

00:18:19.720 --> 00:18:21.660
No way!  That trap card is also...

00:18:21.660 --> 00:18:23.080
...a shadow card?

00:18:42.030 --> 00:18:43.700
Jack!

00:18:49.600 --> 00:18:53.240
What?  Why am I also affected?

00:18:53.870 --> 00:18:55.710
I no longer need you.

00:19:01.470 --> 00:19:02.650
Jack...

00:19:03.340 --> 00:19:05.850
I activate Power Giant's effect!

00:19:06.240 --> 00:19:11.110
When this card battles, I 
don't take effect damage!

00:19:41.100 --> 00:19:43.600
Jack!

00:19:43.600 --> 00:19:44.590
Master Atlas!

00:19:55.260 --> 00:19:58.970
Jack Atlas won't lose to 
the power of the shadows!

00:20:08.470 --> 00:20:11.380
It's over!

00:20:11.640 --> 00:20:13.690
Nicolas's D-Wheel took serious damage!

00:20:13.690 --> 00:20:17.350
He can't pass the baton to the next 
wheeler, so his team is eliminated!

00:20:17.350 --> 00:20:22.060
With two consecutive victories, 
Team 5D's advances to the finals!

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:29.560
Why did you save me?

00:20:29.560 --> 00:20:32.400
Why?  Isn't it obvious?

00:20:32.800 --> 00:20:35.640
It's because you aren't worthy of dying!

00:20:36.050 --> 00:20:38.960
A duel is a clash between souls.

00:20:38.960 --> 00:20:42.880
You don't believe in your own cards 
and resort to using shadow cards.

00:20:43.630 --> 00:20:45.210
You have no right to duel!

00:20:54.820 --> 00:20:55.800
Jack...

00:20:57.000 --> 00:20:58.790
I finally found the information.

00:20:58.790 --> 00:21:02.340
Shadow cards link to Iliaster.

00:21:03.790 --> 00:21:05.870
They failed.

00:21:05.870 --> 00:21:09.920
Why do Placido's ideas always fail?

00:21:14.520 --> 00:21:15.670
Placido?

00:21:30.320 --> 00:21:32.750
Go, Diablos.

00:21:32.750 --> 00:21:35.030
Plummet this city into chaos.

00:21:51.180 --> 00:21:57.130
Close to you  Keep what's 
precious in your heart

00:21:57.130 --> 00:22:05.020
There's only one shining 
soul that's next to you

00:22:16.170 --> 00:22:21.870
You always pretend and hide your fears

00:22:21.870 --> 00:22:27.480
You act tough and don't listen to anyone

00:22:27.480 --> 00:22:33.080
You do this over and over

00:22:33.080 --> 00:22:38.690
I shouted until my soul would break

00:22:38.690 --> 00:22:44.540
Hurry up and throw that away

00:22:44.540 --> 00:22:51.640
We're only heading towards tomorrow

00:22:51.900 --> 00:22:57.610
Close to you   If you're 
trying to find yourself

00:22:57.610 --> 00:23:03.210
Just keep doing what you ultimately decided

00:23:03.210 --> 00:23:08.950
Close to you  Keep what's 
precious in your heart

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:17.130
There's only one shining 
soul that's next to you
